                                    <Path Data="M 12 15 C 10.3 15 9 13.7 9 12 C 9 10.3 10.3 9 12 9 C 13.7 9 15 10.3 15 12 C 15 13.7 13.7 15 12 15 Z M 19.4 13 C 19.4 12.7 19.5 12.3 19.5 12 C 19.5 11.7 19.4 11.3 19.4 11 L 21.5 9.4 C 21.7 9.2 21.8 8.9 21.6 8.7 L 19.6 5.2 C 19.5 5 19.2 4.9 19 5 L 16.5 6 C 16 5.6 15.4 5.3 14.8 5.1 L 14.4 2.4 C 14.4 2.2 14.2 2 13.9 2 H 10 C 9.8 2 9.6 2.2 9.5 2.4 L 9.1 5.1 C 8.5 5.3 8 5.6 7.4 6 L 5 5 C 4.7 4.9 4.4 5 4.3 5.2 L 2.3 8.7 C 2.2 8.9 2.2 9.2 2.4 9.4 L 4.5 11 C 4.5 11.3 4.5 11.7 4.5 12 C 4.5 12.3 4.5 12.7 4.5 13 L 2.4 14.6 C 2.2 14.8 2.2 15.1 2.3 15.3 L 4.3 18.8 C 4.4 19 4.7 19.1 5 19 L 7.4 18 C 8 18.4 8.5 18.7 9.1 18.9 L 9.5 21.6 C 9.6 21.8 9.8 22 10 22 H 13.9 C 14.2 22 14.4 21.8 14.4 21.6 L 14.8 18.9 C 15.4 18.7 16 18.4 16.5 18 L 19 19 C 19.2 19.1 19.5 19 19.6 18.8 L 21.6 15.3 C 21.8 15.1 21.7 14.8 21.5 14.6 Z" 
